    "caveats": [
        "The data is split by promised delivery date: the model is trained on orders due 2010-2013 and tested on orders due 2014-2015. The demo is a replay of those orders, not a live feed.",
        "811 of 2545 test orders were placed before 2014-02-25, the last outcome in the training data, so the model learned from outcomes that came after they were placed. Headline figures use only the orders placed after that date; all-orders figures are shown for comparison.",
        "Model selection on the validation years (orders due 2011-2013) has the same overlap and was not re-run.",
        "risk_score ranks orders; it is not a calibrated probability.",
        "Days late is the historical median and middle half, not a per-order prediction.",
        "Test years were also viewed during the baseline study; treat test numbers as indicative."
